6f2;\n    color: #333;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    padding: 0 4px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin-right: 3px;\n  }\n  .red {\n    color: #e8352b;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"registered\">&#174;</div>\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <figure class=\"placeholder flower-ph\" style=\"margin:0;\">[Illustration: red tulip flower, top-left]</figure>\n      <div class=\"title-block\">\n        <div class=\"title-line\">疑惑点三</div><br>\n        <div class=\"title-line\">赛场上如何发挥</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"body-text\">\n      <p>最快上手辩论方式：打一场堂堂正正的辩论赛</p>\n      <p>注意点：</p>\n      <p><span class=\"num\">1</span>咬字清晰，表达流畅，保持头脑清醒🤔</p>\n      <p>输出观点注意‼️重音/停顿/起伏/气势</p>\n\n      <div class=\"gap\"></div>\n\n      <p><span class=\"num\">2</span>笔不能停，记关键词📝</p>\n      <p>用不同颜色的笔画框标注<span class=\"red\">⭕</span></p>\n\n      <div class=\"gap\"></div>\n\n      <p><span class=\"num\">3</span>反驳思维（挖掘机）</p>\n      <p>挖前提、拆前提；拆逻辑关系；拆数据、削弱效力；</p>\n\n      <div class=\"gap\"></div>\n\n      <p><span class=\"num\">4</span>推论思维（推土机）</p>\n      <p>重申＋延伸论点；举出不同论据；铺陈结辩价值；</p>\n\n      <div class=\"gap\"></div>\n\n      <p><span class=\"num\">5</span>战场意识</p>\n      <p>🙅不恋战（不要为了反驳而反驳但是已经离题）</p>\n      <p>🙅不作死（进攻有利战场和充分准备的战场）</p>\n      <p>🙅不侥幸（不要刻意迴避不利战场，也要充足准备）</p>\n      <p>漫无目的的反驳<span class=\"red\">❌</span>毫无结局的追究<span class=\"red\">❌</span>突如其来的攻击<span class=\"red\">❌</span></p>\n\n      <div class=\"gap\"></div>\n\n      <p><span class=\"num\">6</span>小结意识🔒</p>\n      <p>说给评委听，结束已经攻下的战场</p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
